{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼，好危险好危险。差一点就要来不及了……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4591", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要跟我说一声，我就会去你家了说。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "１２月３１日，除夕。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本纱凪说今天父亲会回家，所以没办法跟我见面。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是就在跨年的３０分钟前她打了电话来。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说她现在过来见我。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是我跟她约在公园见面。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "年底又下了几场雪，把公园妆点成一片雪白。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾没关系吗？虽然是我用电话突然把你叫出来……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4592", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“以前每年都是在家里静静的跨年。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那小樱乃呢？”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4593", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟濑名同学去新年参拜或者去她家玩了。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。那哥哥原本是预定一个人寂寞的跨年呢。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4594", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪牵起我的手。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她大概是跑着来的吧。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有戴手套的手好冷。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪没关系吗？难得你爸爸回家了……”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“本来我们家也是预定家人一起跨年。但是理央吵着叫我出去。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4595", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“他是在体贴我们吧。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是可以用更温柔一点的说法嘛……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4596", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，今年就快要结束了。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4597", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看向手表，今年只剩不到１分钟了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今年受你很多照顾。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我才是，受你照顾了。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人对彼此低下头，然后牵起手。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明年会是怎样的一年呢？”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，好期待喔。”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……希望是美好的一年。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们一起抬头看夜空，等待着那个瞬间。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“５。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4601", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“４。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“３。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4602", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“２。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“１！”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4603", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟纱凪相遇的今年一转眼就结束了。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，两个人一起迎接新年。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新年快乐！今年和明年和后年，都请你多指教啦！”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "_sn4604", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，新年快乐。今年也请多指教喔。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与第一次跟喜欢的女孩子一起迎接新年相比，以前的每次跨年都相形失色了。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是如此地耀眼灿烂。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，机会难得就这样去新年参拜吧？”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6831", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是可以……但是太晚的话你父亲会担心吧？”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我有说或许会去新年参拜了，所以再待１个小时左右没问题。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6832", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯？新吾想跟我在一起待到更晚吗？”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6833", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，那个……”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬间，平安夜的回忆闪过脑海。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然想在一起，但是过年还是得好好珍惜跟家人相处的时间。”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立刻压下冲动。我可不想新年一开始就有痛苦的回忆。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说也对啦，就算过年有些商店会营业，也不是说就能随便跑去新吾的家玩。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6834", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，总之去新年参拜吧！至少逛一下摊贩是OK吧？”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6835", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，那也是新年参拜的重点呢。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪笑着扑向我，我也用微笑回应她。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，我们来到附近的神社。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经有很多人来了，相当热闹，幸好我们没有排很久就来到赛钱箱前。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们丢入硬币，二礼二拍手一礼。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我当然是祈祷今后也能跟纱凪在一起。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然包含了各种意义。不过神明一定能理解的。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，已经该回家了……时间过得好快。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6836", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们逛了一会摊贩后又回到公园，纱凪非常遗憾地碎碎念着。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟现在时间很晚。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我当然也懂纱凪的遗憾。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，最初这样也好吧。”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6837", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么意思？”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正这又不是第一次也是最后一次的跨年和新年参拜……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6838", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“每年，一点一点地增加在一起的时间就好了。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6839", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……跟我？”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不然还有谁？”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6840", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，不是那个意思──”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～这么一想，反而期待起明年了。干脆去登山看日出吧？太过头了吗？”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6841", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，不管怎么说，充满了期待呢～”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6842", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊起未来的事情，纱凪开心地笑着。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──在她描绘的未来中，我理所当然地就在她身旁。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甚至不需要向神明祈求呢。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6843", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃……嗯。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇！新吾你笑得好奇怪！”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6844", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个，纱凪。”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、嗯……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6845", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我最喜欢你了。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6846", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是。最喜欢你了，新吾！”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6847", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“────”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……啊，好厉害。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来是这样。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸，不准让我也笑得这么奇怪！不准把我的新春第一笑也夺走！”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6848", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跨年后不是早就笑过了？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这么说也对。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6849", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“算了，反正夺走的是新吾也好啦♪”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6850", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……再次请你今年也多指教了。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 256, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯！”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 264, "voice": "sn6851", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新年的一切都是喜悦而耀眼。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是纱凪的笑容是其中最灿烂的。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，今年也要好好珍惜守护她。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走吧。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
